<title>CROATIA: Croatian Oct output rises 13.1 pct, 9.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Croatian Oct output rises 13.1 pct, 9.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   OCTOBER   SEPTEMBER    OCT '95</p>
<p> Monthly change pct	     +13.1	 +3.2	 +8.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	     +9.4	 +4.8	 -2.2</p>
<p> Index (base 1995)		116.7	103.1	 98.4</p>
<p>NOTES -- January-October output rise was 3.3 percent from a year-ago period, up from 3.2 percent in the first nine months. Data include estimates for Serb-held Croatian territory where production amounted to two percent of the total before 1991. -- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
